; HerbAlly — apex zone, importable into Cloudflare
;
; Captured from Vercel DNS on 2026-11-10 via
;   vercel api /v4/domains/herbally.app/records --method GET
; 16 records, none of them decorative. The mail ones especially: a
; missing DKIM entry breaks outbound mail silently — the sender sees
; nothing wrong, the recipient never gets the message.
;
; ALIAS is Vercel-only vocabulary. Here it becomes a CNAME at the apex,
; which Cloudflare flattens to A/AAAA for the visitor. If the importer
; refuses a root CNAME, add that one record by hand — same name, same
; target, Proxy status DNS-only until cutover.
;
; TTL 300 on @ and * so the cutover flip lands in five minutes.
; Everything else is 3600; none of it changes on cutover day.

bnc.outreach             3600 IN CNAME bnc.firelet.net.
@                        3600 IN MX 50 mx3.zohocloud.ca.
@                        3600 IN MX 20 mx2.zohocloud.ca.
@                        3600 IN MX 10 mx.zohocloud.ca.
@                        3600 IN TXT "v=spf1 include:zohocloud.ca ~all"
@                        3600 IN TXT "zoho-verification=zb28707388.zmverify.zohocloud.ca"
@                        3600 IN TXT "google-site-verification=gXJ1TP8H2vx6t_-h4Th43u7qetPFlJRFJybws0xxcSM"
_dmarc                   3600 IN TXT "v=DMARC1; p=none; rua=mailto:info@herbally.app; ruf=mailto:info@herbally.app; sp=none; adkim=r; aspf=r; pct=100"
_dmarc.outreach          3600 IN TXT "v=DMARC1; p=none;"
bk1._domainkey.outreach  3600 IN TXT "v=DKIM1; k=rsa; "
zoho._domainkey          3600 IN TXT "v=DKIM1; k=rsa; "
@                        3600 IN CAA 0 issue "pki.goog"
@                        3600 IN CAA 0 issue "sectigo.com"
@                        3600 IN CAA 0 issue "letsencrypt.org"
@                        300 IN CNAME a7dd14f1431f0dc6.vercel-dns-017.com.
*                        300 IN CNAME cname.vercel-dns-016.com.
